# Agent configuration and the working notes. NEVER TRACKED — that is the whole guard, and it is the
# same one every other public ship in the fleet uses. A file git does not track cannot be leaked by a
# push, an IDE, or a forgotten step. There is no whitelist to maintain and no second history to keep
# in sync, because there is nothing to filter.
.claude/
/Design/
/Process/
/Research/
